TITLE

The Kingdom Tale must be published on the PACE page (or linked from it),
polished so it truly sells and explains what PACE is.

RAW_TEXT

En la pagina debe estar el cuento de el reino para entender el uso de
pace. Luego actualiza este cuento y que venda realmente y explique que es
PACE. Tiene que estar publicado en la pagina de pace o en un enlace.

PROPOSED_SCOPE PACE

DESIGN_NOTE

Published as docs/cuento-del-reino.html (own page, same visual language
as the landing) and linked from the landing (nav item "El Cuento" plus a
teaser section). The tale was polished to sell: the amnesia problem told
as a fairy tale, and every character mapped to the real shipped command
("En tu reino: pace init / context / doctor / handoff / remember /
condense / rule / supersede / hook install / update / AGENTS.md").
Chapter IV keeps the President's larger vision (reality comprehension,
Universal Node Model, the Governor, an Organizational Intelligence OS) as
the chapter being written. Ends with a founding CTA: pip install
pace-engine + pace init.

PROMOTED_TO

docs/cuento-del-reino.html + landing nav/teaser (under F3-16)

